
### Add a question
POST http://localhost:8080/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionText": "Which language is used with Spring Boot?",
  "optionA": "Java",
  "optionB": "HTML",
  "optionC": "CSS",
  "optionD": "SQL",
  "correctAnswer": "A"
}

### Get all questions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/questions
